1
00:00:00,235 --> 00:00:02,105
(Sheldon:)Oh, here's another one.

2
00:00:02,104 --> 00:00:06,104
(Sheldon:)I wish that the apple pancake
mix was on the top shelf

3
00:00:06,108 --> 00:00:07,608
because it starts with an "A,"

4
00:00:07,609 --> 00:00:09,409
(Sheldon:)but I don't put it there

5
00:00:09,411 --> 00:00:11,741
(Sheldon:)because I don't want you
breaking one of your little legs

6
00:00:11,747 --> 00:00:14,017
(Sheldon:)when you're supposed
to be making my breakfast.

7
00:00:15,417 --> 00:00:19,417
(Leonard:)Is it my turn to talk
about the compromises I make?

8
00:00:19,421 --> 00:00:23,921
(Sheldon:)I wasn't done, but go ahead.

9
00:00:23,926 --> 00:00:27,456
(Sheldon:)He said, compromising.

10
00:00:27,462 --> 00:00:29,462
(Leonard:)Because of you, I'm not allowed

11
00:00:29,464 --> 00:00:31,464
(Leonard:)to adjust the temperature
in my own home.

12
00:00:31,466 --> 00:00:33,136
(Leonard:)I'm not allowed to whistle.

13
00:00:33,135 --> 00:00:35,335
(Leonard:)I don't wear shoes
that might squeak.

14
00:00:35,337 --> 00:00:38,137
(Sheldon:)Well, you're a physicist,
not a circus clown.

15
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:42,310
(Leonard:)Sheldon, do you realize I don't
live with the woman I love

16
00:00:42,311 --> 00:00:44,011
(Leonard:)because of you?

17
00:00:45,113 --> 00:00:46,483
(Leonard:)No other reason. Just you.

18
00:00:46,481 --> 00:00:48,951
(Sheldon:)Is that true?
Yes, it's true.
The last time

19
00:00:48,951 --> 00:00:50,351
(Leonard:)I brought it up,
you had an emotional breakdown

20
00:00:50,352 --> 00:00:53,452
(Leonard:)and got on a train and ran away.

21
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:55,185
(Sheldon:)Well, given my history
on the subject,

22
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:57,990
it seems a little reckless
to bring it up now.

